settings reset	flag server	server address (overrides config server.addr)
settings reset	flag token	bearer token override (prefer config/env: GOFER_SERVER_TOKEN)
settings set	desc	Write one setting (value argument, or --file for a multi-line value)
settings set	help	The value is converted to the key's registered type, so a list key takes a
comma-separated value and an int key a number:

  gofer settings set work.draft.min_prompts 3
  gofer settings set work.draft.exclude_projects "demo,sandbox"
  gofer settings set prompt.work.summarizer --file prompt.md
  cat prompt.md | gofer settings set prompt.work.summarizer --file -

The server validates the value and refuses (non-zero exit) with its reason.
settings set	examples	
settings set	flag config	path to the gofer config file
settings set	flag file	read the value from this file ('-' reads stdin), for multi-line prompts
settings set	flag server	server address (overrides config server.addr)
settings set	flag token	bearer token override (prefer config/env: GOFER_SERVER_TOKEN)
